  "scope": "balanced synthetic MCP startup/discovery/tool/resource workload, three fresh-home trials per mode after one warmup each; managed service stopped during all trials",
  "limitations": [
    "No model inference, speech, cloud WAN or complete user-turn workload.",
    "Host samples cover direct controller process (remote modes) or SSH transport (local mode), not full process trees.",
    "RSS is not PSS; host and device have different architectures; device/host ticks need their respective CLK_TCK.",
    "Sequential warm-cache operation, no page-cache flush; external fixture/tunnel/sampler costs not individually attributed.",
    "Native v1.3 and standalone v1 use low-memory pool feature; stock 0.166.0 controller uses upstream defaults.",
    "Only three measured trials per mode; no cache eviction or machine reboot; OS background work is not fully controlled.",
    "RSS does not isolate heap/shared executable pages and cannot be summed as PSS. Device and controller process trees are not fully accounted.",
    "This confirms only the synthetic startup/MCP fixture; do not extrapolate to model-inference, hosted Cloud or speech latency."
  ],
